{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03926","headline":"早朝 · 韦元旦","name":"早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"震维芳月季，宸极衆星尊。\n佩玉朝三陛，鸣珂度九门。\n挈壶分早漏，伏槛耀初暾。\n北倚苍龙阙，西临紫凤垣。\n词庭草欲奏，温室树无言。\n鳞翰空爲忝，长怀圣主恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦元旦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}